2.
Definitions.
- In these Rules, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,-
(a)
'Appointing Authority' means the Director of Economics and Statistics;
(b)
'Board' means the Selection Board constituted under Rule 17;
(c)
'Commission' means the Assam Public Service Commission;
(d)
'Constitution' means the Constitution of India;
(e)
'Government' means the Government of Assam;
(f)
'Governor' means the Governor of Assam;
(g)
'Member' means a member of the Service;
(h)
'Select list' means the final list as referred to in Clause (d) of Rule 6 (1), sub-rule (6) of Rule 11; sub-rule (6) of Rule 13,
sub-rule (2) of Rule 15 and sub-rule (2) of Rule 16, as the case may be;
(i)
'Year' means a calendar year.
